# Windows leg: 42 red tests down to 1, and the last one was this repository's own test (2026-10-04)

The 42 failures are traced in `docs/verification/windows-test-failures-2026-10-03.log` and the
three that followed them in `docs/verification/maintenance-line-review-2026-10-04.log`
section 10. This log covers the last one, which was not shipped code: a test written on a
Linux host was asserting something that cannot hold on Windows, and no run before CI had
ever executed it. It also covers what was built to settle that without a Windows machine.

